          "text": "SCHNVG",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">SCHNVG</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "SCHNVF",
          "html": "<span style=\"\">SCHNVF</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Here, we use the table given below:<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/05/Alphabet%20Dia.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 606px; height: 129px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>The logic followed in the given information:</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Madhuri_Engineering_06.10.2022_D3_V2.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 216px;\" />&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>And;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Madhuri_Engineering_06.10.2022_D2_V2.png\" style=\"width: 184px; height: 216px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Similarly;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Madhuri_Engineering_06.10.2022_D1_V2.png\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 207px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Here, the SCHNVG is the correct answer as per logic.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, the correct answer is <strong>&quot;SCHNVG&quot;.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/05/Alphabet%20Dia.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/22/10/F3_Madhuri_Engineering_06.10.2022_D3_V2.png",
