    {
      "id": "7ee89ba79d15-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "In a certain code language, 'RELAX' is written as 'CPPZC' and 'STAKE' is written as 'RQEGM'. How will 'WINDS' be written in that language?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language, &#39;RELAX&#39; is written as &#39;CPPZC&#39; and &#39;STAKE&#39; is written as &#39;RQEGM&#39;. How will &#39;WINDS&#39; be written in that language?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "GURUF",
          "html": "GURUF"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "HUSVG",
          "html": "HUSVG"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "HURVG",
          "html": "HURVG"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "GVSUF",
          "html": "GVSUF"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Logic :</span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">First two letters → </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(2) is subtracted from the position value according to English alphabetic series diagonally.</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">third letter </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">→ (4) is added to the position value according to English alphabetic series.</span></li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Last two letters </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">→ </span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">(2) is added to the position value according to English alphabetic series diagonally.</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">So,</span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\n\t<li>'WINDS' will be written as :</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/02/F1_SSC_%20Priya_14-2-24_D55.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 257px; height: 184px;\" /></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/02/F1_SSC_%20Priya_14-2-24_D55.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7ee89ba79d15-q10",
