          "id": "A",
          "text": "SOXIASY",
          "html": "SOXIASY"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "XYRIBSY",
          "html": "XYRIBSY"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "XYQIJSY",
          "html": "XYQIJSY"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "XYRJBSY",
          "html": "XYRJBSY"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png\" style=\"width: 536px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Here <strong>consonants gets replacing by +5 letters and vowels gets replacing by -3 letters.</strong></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">For Vowel&nbsp;&rarr; Vowel - 3</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">For Consonant&nbsp;&rarr; Consonant + 5</span></p>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/16/04/SSC%20CGL%20Mock%20Test%20-%2045_2tushti%20reviewed%20%282%29_Images_Q2.PNG\" style=\"height:242px; width:118px\" /></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Similarly,</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/16/04/SSC%20CGL%20Mock%20Test%20-%2045_2tushti%20reviewed%20%282%29_Images_Q2a.PNG\" style=\"height:287px; width:116px\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence STUDENT is coded as <strong>XYRIBSY.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https:https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/01/Common_Diagram_28.01.2020_D1.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/16/04/SSC%20CGL%20Mock%20Test%20-%2045_2tushti%20reviewed%20%282%29_Images_Q2.PNG",
